{"title":"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/1536f9b73d2c7e2b69c3bb9149ffa378ce557771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8eb2cb0cf3c53328e172b4cf6f48f09f2f8e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/9/92975e8a06c0a3cc02a3604b13788d58402eef4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 2y) - (2x + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d30ce0d35b57fd28a1ee9419cfaba75afe99241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   -2y \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   -y \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   0 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   y \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   2y \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/1536f9b73d2c7e2b69c3bb9149ffa378ce557771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c5cb752699559e7268793b98a9fe1d72072abf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2y + 2y) - (2 \\times 2y + y) = 4y - (4y + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"323\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77e128686eac442434e6bf6ee6fddb231b71d0ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4y - 4y - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/2/522618553af22d5e1ecd7ffc72e163d62aa18ec1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } -y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"99\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/f/aaf41f6849e199f6d212d69b68bc86255776e5a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 2y) - (2x + y) = x + 2y - 2x - y = -x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"384\" height=\"20\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/1536f9b73d2c7e2b69c3bb9149ffa378ce557771.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> into this, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afebb5b4983dca74e7c8abf58dad839d3a4bc919.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2y + y = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } -y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"169\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12\">2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page